//! an exponential dependence δ ∼ e− V2 61 . Interestingly,
//! whereas exponential dependences of that form are typical
//! for superconducting instabilities driven by attractive interactions62 , in our present case interactions are actually
//! repulsive. This behavior stems from the projection of the
//! interactions in the low energy solitonic model of Eq. 7,
