//! setups79 are potential platforms for the realization of
//! our model, as honeycomb structures80 , antiferromagnetic
//! correlations81 , long-range interactions82–84 and s-wave
//! correlations85 in the normal state have been separately
//! demonstrated. Interactions can be tuned from attractive
