//! Appendix S2: Impact of disorder
//!
//! The robustness to disorder is one of the crucial points
//! of any proposal for Majorana states63–65 . Since the fundamental physics of our proposal comes from the interface modes, for the sake of concreteness here we will in
//! the following focus on disorder effects that affect the interface.
//! First, we address the impact of Anderson disorder in
//! a periodic supercell in the x−direction. For this goal we
//! take a supercell of 5 in the x−direction, include Anderson
//! disorder by adding a term to the Hamiltonian of the form
